  "id": "coldwatercontaineryard",
  "note": "COLDWATER CONTAINER YARD — the gate of the Coldwater Container Yard on Dray Lane.\n\nThe tile's prose: a chain-link gate on a rolling track, and behind it corroded shipping cans\nstacked four high in canyons that groan when the wind comes off the Basin; a tally board by the\ngate with box numbers nobody has reconciled in years.\n\nSo the front is a palisade with the gate rolled back, the tally board on it and a gatehouse hut,\nand behind it three rows of containers stacked to different heights with aisles between them. A\nworks doesn't sign itself (UNSIGNED_TRADE), so the name is a plate on the hut. Each container is\nan explicit long box: `box` defaults `fd` to `hw`, and a square container is a warehouse.",
  "pal": "ty_yard_tarmac",
